---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
import {site} from '../data/site';
interface Props { placement: 'home' | 'news'; wide?: boolean }
const {placement, wide = false} = Astro.props;
---
<aside class:list={['x-profile', {'x-profile-wide': wide}]} aria-label="KUMC公式X">
  <div class="x-profile-icon" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.9 2H22l-6.8 7.8L23.2 22H17l-4.8-7.3L5.8 22H2.6l8.2-9.4L1 2h6.4l4.4 6.7L18.9 2ZM17.8 20h1.7L6.4 4H4.6l13.2 16Z"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="x-profile-copy">
    <p class="section-label">FOLLOW US</p>
    <h2><span>Xでも活動を</span><span>発信しています。</span></h2>
    <p>例会やイベントのお知らせ、日々の活動を公式Xでお届けします。</p>
  </div>
  <a href={site.x} class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-event="social_click" data-platform="x" data-placement={placement}>@KUMC_X <span>プロフィールを見る</span> <Arrow external/></a>
</aside>
